1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,640
I get what you're saying, but before you came along, I thought I'd always be alone in life.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,920
And here I am with my very own family.

3
00:00:08,780 --> 00:00:11,380
You made that possible, so thank you.

4
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:18,240
She said thank you, but I can't remember what for.

5
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:23,900
Uh-oh, someone's hungry.

6
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:25,480
Okay, okay.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:41,680
I remember now. I saved Kaio's life.

8
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:48,640
After that, I made sure Misato and Aya were never alone to keep him safe from the kidnapper.

9
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:50,640
And then...

10
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:59,220
Yeah, Shiro.

11
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:04,600
I remember everything, you son of a bitch.

12
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:17,940
君を待った 僕は待った 途切れない明日も過ぎたって

13
00:01:17,940 --> 00:01:31,920
君を待った 僕は待った 途切れない明日も過ぎたって

14
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:38,160
立ち止まって 振り返って 止めどない今日を嘆き合った

15
00:01:38,160 --> 00:01:44,300
記憶だって 記憶だって 終わりだって 残らないもんと思い知って

16
00:01:44,300 --> 00:01:49,840
僕はずっと かき虫って 心隅っこで泣いた

17
00:01:49,840 --> 00:02:03,580
Outro Music

18
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:46,840
No way, Kazu's a carpenter?

19
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:48,840
He and Osamu look like they're doing great.

20
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:53,840
By the way, Misato said she was going to come by and see you.

21
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,840
What? Really?

22
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:58,840
I thought she hated my guts after what happened in class.

23
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:03,840
Yeah, I remember that. The lunch money thing she pulled was so messed up.

24
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:08,840
It was. But don't forget who started raising funds to help pay Satori's medical bills.

25
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:10,840
She did that too.

26
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:12,840
I had no idea.

27
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:16,840
Tell us about the day you tailed her. You know, when you saw the killer.

28
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:19,840
You knew it. You do remember everything.

29
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:25,840
But then why didn't you tell us?

30
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:31,840
I didn't want to get you involved. It's been 15 years.

31
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:36,840
Whatever evidence there was is gone by now. And besides, who'd believe me?

32
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:47,840
Like you said, it's been 15 years. Now that you're back, I couldn't be happier because it's a miracle you woke up at all.

33
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:52,840
That's why I didn't bring it up before. To spare you from the shock.

34
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:59,840
The last thing you need is someone digging up the past when you're trying to recover. But you remember everything.

35
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:08,840
So, if you want to catch the killer, you don't have to do it alone. Let us help you.

36
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:13,840
Hiromi's been coming here to visit you all these years. And now, he wants to be a doctor.

37
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:18,840
I became a lawyer. And now I'm working with Mr. Sawada to catch the killer.

38
00:04:18,840 --> 00:04:22,840
Hiromi and I are who we are because of you, Satoru.

39
00:04:22,840 --> 00:04:27,840
You were a hero to us back then. And we want to help you again. Just like old times.

40
00:04:27,840 --> 00:04:36,840
Just like we helped with Kaio. You trusted me enough back then. Believed in me. You remember? That's why I believed in you.

41
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:45,840
If someone believes in you, you're not alone. And if I was in your situation, I'd want someone to believe me.

42
00:04:46,840 --> 00:04:47,840
Ayuri.

43
00:04:51,840 --> 00:04:56,840
I'm not alone. I have friends I can count on.

44
00:04:57,840 --> 00:05:02,840
The killer is... Yashiro.

45
00:05:03,840 --> 00:05:05,840
I knew you remembered.

46
00:05:06,840 --> 00:05:10,840
On the way up here, I tapped my finger on your wheelchair a couple times.

47
00:05:11,840 --> 00:05:14,840
I could tell you tried hard not to react.

48
00:05:16,840 --> 00:05:21,840
Fifteen years ago, you figured out what I was doing and ruined my plans.

49
00:05:27,840 --> 00:05:28,840
But how?

50
00:05:31,840 --> 00:05:32,840
But how?

51
00:05:34,840 --> 00:05:37,840
A child isn't capable of such things.

52
00:05:41,840 --> 00:05:43,840
It's as if you were psychic or something.

53
00:05:44,840 --> 00:05:47,840
Yashiro! I know your future!

54
00:05:52,840 --> 00:05:58,840
Let's have it. How did you know what I was thinking? What did you mean, you know my future?

55
00:05:58,840 --> 00:06:02,840
What difference does it make? As soon as I tell you, you'll kill me.

56
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:15,840
Oh, I know what you're up to. You've got a phone in your pocket. Are you recording us? Or is someone listening in? Kenya, perhaps?

57
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:35,840
You have heard of the statute of limitations. Even if I confessed, I can't be tried for things I did fifteen years ago.

58
00:06:36,840 --> 00:06:39,840
And I haven't done anything wrong since then.

59
00:06:40,840 --> 00:06:44,840
So you see, no matter what you do, you can never get me, Satoru.

60
00:06:45,840 --> 00:06:48,840
Oh, look. Kumi just sent you an email.

61
00:06:49,840 --> 00:06:52,840
At 4.30, she'll get her daily IV.

62
00:06:52,840 --> 00:06:59,840
I put a muscle relaxant in her dose and made sure your fingerprints were all over the bag.

63
00:07:00,840 --> 00:07:05,840
That poor little girl who was afraid of her operation will die peacefully now, thanks to you.

64
00:07:06,840 --> 00:07:10,840
And feeling guilty, I throw myself off the roof, isn't that right?

65
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:24,840
There you go, reading my mind again. While that might be an amazing skill, it won't save your life. But you might save Kumi's if you tell me what I want to know.

66
00:07:25,840 --> 00:07:28,840
If I do, then what? How do I know you won't kill her anyway?

67
00:07:29,840 --> 00:07:36,840
I can't guarantee I won't, naturally. But there is a possibility. If you don't talk, there won't even be that.

68
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:47,840
I hate to say it. We're out of time now. There was a 50-50 chance you'd tell me how you knew about me back then.

69
00:07:48,840 --> 00:07:50,840
Oh well, I guess it doesn't matter anymore.

70
00:07:51,840 --> 00:07:57,840
I'm sure it was just a coincidence when you screamed you knew my future. That was just a bluff.

71
00:08:00,840 --> 00:08:06,840
As for your mother, we should send her an email. Let her know how sorry you are.

72
00:08:06,840 --> 00:08:12,840
Hey, kiddo. I have to work the morning shift tomorrow, so I'll see you in the afternoon.

73
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:15,840
I'll let him sleep.

74
00:08:18,840 --> 00:08:19,840
Mom.

75
00:08:22,840 --> 00:08:24,840
I lied to you. I got my-

76
00:08:24,840 --> 00:08:28,840
Your memory back? I know. It happened when Kaio came by.

77
00:08:28,840 --> 00:08:34,840
Yup, she's a witch. You're right. But how come you didn't tell her not to bring up the past?

78
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:44,840
After Kenya and Hiromi stopped by, I felt I made a mistake telling them not to bring any of it up.

79
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:47,840
They couldn't say what they wanted, and that wasn't fair.

80
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:52,840
When Kaio showed up with her baby, I didn't have the heart to ask her to do the same.

81
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:58,840
After waiting all this time for you to wake up. Who am I to stop her?

82
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:03,840
I got to see your face and talk to you every day for the last 15 years.

83
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:07,840
Then when I heard you speak, your voice all crackly.

84
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:10,840
It finally hit me. You weren't a kid anymore.

85
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:12,840
I was happy.

86
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:15,840
My boy grew up.

87
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:22,840
Mom.

88
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:24,840
I'm gonna take life head on.

89
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:27,840
What in the heck are you talking about?

90
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:31,840
Even when you were a little kid, you always took it head on, remember?

91
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:42,840
Life is about filling up the void in yourself.

92
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:47,840
Indeed. Whenever I taught sixth grade, I always told the class that.

93
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:52,840
I remember what your face looked like. The day they took Kaio from her mom.

94
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:56,840
The expression you had stuck with me even after all these years.

95
00:09:56,840 --> 00:10:01,840
A little while after I was born, my dad took off.

96
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:04,840
So I have no idea what he looks like.

97
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:10,840
But that day at Kaio's, you were the dad I never had and always wanted.

98
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:14,840
At that moment, you filled the void in me.

99
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:24,840
For the last 15 years, I've been waiting for you to wake up.

100
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:29,840
When you slipped into your coma, I lost the impulse that defined me.

101
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:32,840
The thing that gave my life meaning.

102
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:34,840
I've waited a long time.

103
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:36,840
But now...

104
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:38,840
You're not alone anymore.

105
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:41,840
So, how are we gonna settle this?

106
00:10:42,840 --> 00:10:43,840
Are you gonna turn yourself in?

107
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:45,840
Or kill me?

108
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:47,840
Which is it?

109
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:49,840
It's already settled, actually.

110
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:52,840
You're right. I beat you.

111
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:55,840
I saved all of them from you.

112
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:59,840
Kaio, Aya, Hiromi, Yuki.

113
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:02,840
Even my mom who you haven't killed yet.

114
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:04,840
Your mom? Why would I kill...

115
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:05,840
Why would I kill...

116
00:11:06,840 --> 00:11:08,840
Hold on. Are you saying you can?

117
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:10,840
I'm just telling you what you wanted to know.

118
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:14,840
I could screw up all your plans because I knew your future.

119
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:16,840
That's it.

120
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:19,840
That's how I saved them all.

121
00:11:20,840 --> 00:11:23,840
That's why you weren't able to kill anyone I was even remotely connected to.

122
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:26,840
Why you couldn't kill me.

123
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:28,840
Wrong.

124
00:11:28,840 --> 00:11:30,840
I could've killed you anytime I wanted.

125
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:32,840
Now, for instance.

126
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:34,840
But for 15 years, you let me live.

127
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:36,840
Why did you do that?

128
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:38,840
Oh, I know.

129
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:40,840
You needed me, didn't you?

130
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:42,840
I was your reason for living.

131
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:44,840
I was your hope.

132
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:48,840
I was the one who filled the void in you.

133
00:11:51,840 --> 00:11:54,840
I beat you back then, Mr. Yashiro.

134
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:55,840
No!

135
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:57,840
No!

136
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:58,840
No!

137
00:11:58,840 --> 00:11:59,840
No!

138
00:11:59,840 --> 00:12:00,840
Even now...

139
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:02,840
I beat you!

140
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:03,840
No!

141
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:06,840
No!

142
00:12:09,840 --> 00:12:11,840
No, we were supposed to be there.

143
00:12:11,840 --> 00:12:12,840
Yeah!

144
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:13,840
No!

145
00:12:13,840 --> 00:12:15,840
No!

146
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:17,840
No!

147
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:18,840
No!

148
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:20,840
No!

149
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:23,840
No!

150
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:27,840
You see what I mean?

151
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:29,140
You can't kill me.

152
00:12:33,140 --> 00:12:35,140
Fifteen years is a long time.

153
00:12:36,740 --> 00:12:40,240
I was asleep, so for me it all went by in a flash.

154
00:12:40,340 --> 00:12:43,340
But for you, it must have felt like forever.

155
00:12:57,840 --> 00:13:15,140
You're still alive, because I'm around.

156
00:13:16,140 --> 00:13:18,220
I make you feel alive.

157
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:26,360
I had to relive a part of my life over and over again.

158
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:29,160
The part where you killed some of my friends.

159
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:30,420
Funny.

160
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:33,240
I should hate you, but I don't.

161
00:13:34,060 --> 00:13:37,100
Because right now, I'm the only one who knows you.

162
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:39,640
The real you.

163
00:13:45,680 --> 00:13:46,760
You're right.

164
00:13:52,040 --> 00:13:52,720
Satoru.

165
00:13:56,360 --> 00:13:57,680
I can't live.

166
00:14:07,060 --> 00:14:07,880
You're right.

167
00:14:10,580 --> 00:14:13,120
I can't go on living without you.

168
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:26,680
I can't live.

169
00:14:26,680 --> 00:14:56,660
I'll see you next time.

170
00:14:56,680 --> 00:15:03,500
The police are charging him with attempted murder.

171
00:15:04,580 --> 00:15:05,620
Is Kumi okay?

172
