Yeah.

173
00:15:07,400 --> 00:15:08,780
But I didn't tell her about him.

174
00:15:09,220 --> 00:15:10,780
What with her surgery coming up and all.

175
00:15:11,460 --> 00:15:11,760
Good.

176
00:15:12,880 --> 00:15:13,980
I believe in you.

177
00:15:14,240 --> 00:15:15,380
