179
00:15:16,540 --> 00:15:17,420
Well, think about it.

180
00:15:17,860 --> 00:15:21,140
If you really believe in someone, chances are they already know you do.

181
00:15:21,860 --> 00:15:23,800
Saying it's kind of redundant, don't you think?

182
00:15:24,520 --> 00:15:25,480
Not if you mean it.

183
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:27,520
And you want someone to know you do.

184
00:15:28,180 --> 00:15:28,520
Yeah.

185
00:15:29,440 --> 00:15:32,300
I guess we say it because we want to give someone hope.

186
