Hope to keep fighting.

187
00:15:34,980 --> 00:15:37,080
To let them know they're not alone in the world.

188
00:15:37,400 --> 00:15:37,640
Right?

189
00:15:37,640 --> 00:15:53,760
Now my life has a blank spot between the ages of 11 and 25.

190
00:15:55,560 --> 00:15:59,280
But in a weird way, I sort of treasure the time I lost.

191
00:15:59,280 --> 00:16:06,280
In a town without me, my friends lived for themselves and for me.

192
00:16:08,780 --> 00:16:11,440
Heroes always show up at the last minute, right?

193
00:16:11,760 --> 00:16:12,840
Oh, hey, Storo.

194
00:16:13,020 --> 00:16:13,700
About time.

195
00:16:13,820 --> 00:16:14,400
Where you been?

196
