You're an idiot.

197
00:16:15,820 --> 00:16:17,060
Are you ever on time?

198
00:16:17,060 --> 00:16:18,560
A town without me.

199
00:16:19,180 --> 00:16:20,560
Time without me.

200
00:16:23,220 --> 00:16:24,720
It's not my loss.

201
00:16:25,020 --> 00:16:26,120
It's my treasure.

202
00:16:26,120 --> 00:16:27,120
It's my treasure.

203
00:16:33,780 --> 00:16:34,220
Whoa.

204
00:16:34,220 --> 00:16:35,680
This is great.

205
00:16:36,020 --> 00:16:39,960
Whenever you dig deep, you always come up with the most amazing angles.

206
00:16:40,780 --> 00:16:41,160
Thanks.

207
00:16:41,660 --> 00:16:43,180
I guess I'll keep working on it then.

208
00:16:43,540 --> 00:16:44,100
Atta boy.

209
00:16:44,660 --> 00:16:46,280
And sorry you had to schlep out here.

210
00:16:46,940 --> 00:16:48,140
