211
00:16:48,380 --> 00:16:48,660
Yep.

212
00:16:49,280 --> 00:16:51,000
Going back to Hokkaido for a break.

213
00:16:51,340 --> 00:16:52,620
There's some old friends I want to see.

214
00:16:52,620 --> 00:16:54,720
Well, have yourself a great time then.

215
00:16:55,380 --> 00:16:57,320
Safe travels and have a good weekend.

216
00:16:58,940 --> 00:16:59,940
Almost forgot.

217
00:17:00,640 --> 00:17:02,700
Congrats on your anime getting the green light.

218
00:17:09,620 --> 00:17:12,020
I write and draw manga for a living now.

219
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:18,940
As for revival, I haven't had another.

220
00:17:22,620 --> 00:17:34,600
One other time, I will notice you all of a sudden love used to keep watching.

221
00:17:34,600 --> 00:17:40,600
The joy is all...

222
00:17:40,600 --> 00:17:43,600
I'm a big man.

223
00:17:43,600 --> 00:17:46,600
I'm a優しく...

224
00:17:46,600 --> 00:17:51,600
I'm a big man.

225
00:17:51,600 --> 00:17:54,600
When I was a child,

226
00:17:54,600 --> 00:17:57,600
I was just like you.

227
00:17:57,600 --> 00:18:01,600
I want you to protect me.

228
00:18:01,600 --> 00:18:08,600
When I saw a guy when I try to get back to me

229
00:18:08,600 --> 00:18:13,600
The passion me for my eyes!

230
00:18:13,600 --> 00:18:19,600
I knew nothing after all you had instances..

231
00:18:19,600 --> 00:18:24,600
Your man Deutschland史這個地方

232
00:18:24,600 --> 00:18:27,600
Who saw me tonight?

233
00:18:27,600 --> 00:18:48,200
The 2010 Olympics in Vancouver are just two short weeks away.

234
00:18:48,200 --> 00:18:52,620
The athletes representing Japan are already champions of the business and they're training

235
00:18:52,620 --> 00:18:57,620
for the rest of the world.

236
00:18:57,620 --> 00:18:58,620
I'm gonna go out for a walk.

237
00:18:58,620 --> 00:19:00,620
We'll hold the fort down.

238
00:19:00,620 --> 00:19:01,620
Later, boss.

239
00:19:01,620 --> 00:19:06,620
Oh, I heard we'll be getting some more snow later on, so take a jacket.

240
00:19:22,620 --> 00:19:43,620
My Hero by Satoru Fujinuma.

241
